  "cost": { "wallClockMinutes": 14, "workedBy": "agent", "notes": "4 fetch attempts (2 x 404 on guessed URLs) + 1 search + 1 PDF. The single-program pages (qmb.htm) and the multi-program PDF (P-10062) tell different-sized stories; needed the PDF for the full tier structure." },
  "surprises": [
